If you control a WATER monster: Activate 1 of these effects, or if you control a WATER Ritual Monster, [b]you can[/b] activate both of these effects, in sequence;
● Look at all Set cards in your opponent's Spell & Trap Zone.
● Look at the top 2 cards of either player's Deck, [b]then[/b] place them on the top of the Deck in any order.

